Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the "Open with MarkPaste" right-click entry.
; The second key is the name this used before the project was renamed — left
; here so an older install is cleaned up too. Deleting a key that was never
; created is harmless.

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\SystemFileAssociations\.md\shell\OpenWithMarkPaste]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\SystemFileAssociations\.md\shell\OpenWithMarkdownRenderer]
